flowchart TD
    A["control() called<br/><i>every cycle, identically</i>"] --> B["parse extra_parameters<br/>_parse_match_trace_parameters<br/>rcond, max_drive_coherence,<br/>startup_test_level_cap_db<br/>defaults 1e-15, 1.0, −9.0"]
    B --> C["BUZZ SUBSTITUTION<br/>modified_spec =<br/>match_coherence_phase(S, sysid_response_cpsd)<br/><i>spec autospectra, measured<br/>coherence and phase</i>"]
    C --> D["pseudoinverse solve<br/>X = H⁺ · modified_spec · (H⁺)ᴴ"]
    D --> E{"last_output_cpsd<br/>is None?"}
    E -->|yes, first call only| F["startup clamp<br/>scale so tr(X) ≤<br/>10^(startup_cap_db/10) · tr(S)"]
    E -->|no| G["unchanged"]
    F --> H["drive-coherence cap"]
    G --> H
    H --> I["return drive CPSD X"]
    J["The substituted target is REACHABLE:<br/>it carries the plant's own coherence<br/>structure rather than the spec's<br/>unreachable diagonal. Worth 1.1 dB and<br/>a third of the drive vs pseudoinverse."] -.-> C
    K["sysid_response_cpsd is frozen at<br/>system ID — it does NOT refresh during<br/>control. Only the FRF adapts.<br/>last_response_cpsd is never read."] -.-> C
